<title>USA: Donna Karan names Ann McLaughlin to board.</title>
<headline>Donna Karan names Ann McLaughlin to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donna Karan International Inc said it named Ann McLaughlin to its board of directors.</p>
<p>The addition of McLaughlin, who is chairman of the Aspen Institute, increases the size of the board to seven members.</p>
<p>The company said McLaughlin was U.S. Secretary of Labor from 1987 to 1989. She also served as chairman of the President's Commission on Aviation Security and Terrorism from 1989 to 1990 and as Under Secretary of the Department of the Interior from 1984 to 1987.</p>
</text>
